[{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0069","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0069.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-18491","title":"WordPress contact-form-plugin插件跨站脚本漏洞","description":"WordPress 的 contact-form-plugin 插件（版本低于 4.0.6）存在多个跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞。该漏洞源于插件未能对用户输入的数据进行充分的过滤与转义处理，导致攻击者可通过构造恶意的表单数据或参数注入任意 JavaScript 代码。当管理员或其他用户访问受影响的页面时，恶意脚本将在浏览器中执行，可能导致敏感信息泄露（如会话 Cookie）、页面内容篡改或钓鱼攻击。攻击者需要诱使用户点击恶意链接或访问特制页面，无需身份认证即可触发，影响范围涉及该插件的所有使用版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2017-18491"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-08-13T17:15:13Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:12:56Z","remediation":"升级 WordPress contact-form-plugin 至 4.0.6 或更高版本。如无法立即升级，可在 WordPress 后台禁用该插件，或通过 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）添加规则过滤 XSS 攻击载荷作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["https://wordpress.org/plugins/contact-form-plugin/#developers","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-18491.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-18491.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4924c84cac6ce9772babf48587bed8df9d0040d0/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-18491.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2017-18491.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/93bf7691fc17bf58197ad166ee362b4808566d7c/cves/2017/18xxx/CVE-2017-18491.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d2f32d8750bd50219425137a8fc56ab841cc707b/CVE/data/2017/CVE-2017-18491.json","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder5/CVE-2017-18491.yaml","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2017/CVE-2017-18491.rules","https://github.com/topscoder/nuclei-wordfence-cve/blob/bdcc854494aa2f43778044680cffe9dd4de3de0e/nuclei-templates/2017/CVE-2017-18491-contact_form_plugin-c7c36911-4afe-4ac7-9a76-7365bb86f81c.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2017-18491.yaml","https://github.com/youki992/VscanPlus/blob/714a0e276a538a22c1a6215c71458a8b59a920ef/pocs_yml/nucleiFiles/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-18491.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2017/POC-AVE-2017-0069.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2017/EXP-AVE-2017-0069.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0069.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0068","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0068.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-18490","title":"WordPress contact-form-multi 插件跨站脚本漏洞","description":"WordPress contact-form-multi插件在1.2.1之前版本存在多个跨站脚本攻击（XSS）漏洞（CWE-79）。该漏洞源于插件未对用户提交的表单数据进行充分的安全过滤和转义处理，导致攻击者可注入恶意JavaScript代码。未授权远程攻击者可通过构造包含恶意脚本的表单输入字段，当管理员或其他用户访问受影响页面时，恶意代码将在其浏览器中执行。利用该漏洞可窃取用户会话凭证、篡改页面内容、实施钓鱼攻击或进行恶意重定向，影响所有安装并启用该插件的WordPress网站。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2017-18490"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-08-13T17:15:13Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:12:56Z","remediation":"立即将 WordPress 的 Contact Form Multi 插件升级至 1.2.1 或更高版本。登录 WordPress 后台，进入「插件」→「已安装插件」，找到 Contact Form Multi 点击「立即更新」；或从 WordPress 插件目录重新下载安装。如无法立即更新，可暂时禁用该插件，并移除所有 `bws_panel` 页面中未经验证的 `category` 参数输出作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["https://wordpress.org/plugins/contact-form-multi/#developers","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-18490.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-18490.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4924c84cac6ce9772babf48587bed8df9d0040d0/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-18490.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2017-18490.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/93bf7691fc17bf58197ad166ee362b4808566d7c/cves/2017/18xxx/CVE-2017-18490.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d2f32d8750bd50219425137a8fc56ab841cc707b/CVE/data/2017/CVE-2017-18490.json","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder1/CVE-2017-18490.yaml","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2017/CVE-2017-18490.rules","https://github.com/topscoder/nuclei-wordfence-cve/blob/bdcc854494aa2f43778044680cffe9dd4de3de0e/nuclei-templates/2017/CVE-2017-18490-contact_form_multi-887ccf72-9ae1-4b7e-9f62-253dea459652.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2017-18490.yaml","https://github.com/youki992/VscanPlus/blob/714a0e276a538a22c1a6215c71458a8b59a920ef/pocs_yml/nucleiFiles/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-18490.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0068.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0078","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0078.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-18505","title":"WordPress Twitter插件跨站脚本漏洞","description":"WordPress twitter-plugin 插件（版本低于 2.55）存在跨站脚本漏洞（XSS）。该漏洞源于插件对用户输入的数据缺乏充分的过滤与转义处理，攻击者可利用该漏洞在页面中注入恶意脚本。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过诱使用户点击特制链接触发漏洞，导致恶意脚本在用户浏览器中执行，从而窃取 Cookie、会话令牌或重定向用户至恶意站点。该漏洞影响所有使用 twitter-plugin 插件且版本低于 2.55 的 WordPress 站点，CVSS 评分 6.1，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2017-18505"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-08-12T16:15:13Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:12:59Z","remediation":"立即将 WordPress twitter-plugin 插件升级至 2.55 或更高版本。如无法立即更新，可在 WordPress 后台禁用该插件，并启用 WordPress 自带的 Jetpack 或第三方社交媒体分享插件作为替代。同时建议在 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）层面添加针对 XSS 的过滤规则，对用户输入内容进行 HTML 实体编码转义。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["https://wordpress.org/plugins/twitter-plugin/#developers","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-18505.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-18505.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4924c84cac6ce9772babf48587bed8df9d0040d0/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-18505.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2017-18505.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0118bdf83d51e7ec6262ccd7acc694cb751b5bf8/cves/2017/18xxx/CVE-2017-18505.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6550296d9cb5b12971003dddc7912cdc0707af50/CVE/data/2017/CVE-2017-18505.json","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder4/CVE-2017-18505.yaml","https://github.com/topscoder/nuclei-wordfence-cve/blob/bdcc854494aa2f43778044680cffe9dd4de3de0e/nuclei-templates/2017/CVE-2017-18505-twitter_plugin-1b1d4180-091c-4679-a8d2-a6915ec05772.yaml","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2017/CVE-2017-18505.rules","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2017-18505.yaml","https://github.com/youki992/VscanPlus/blob/714a0e276a538a22c1a6215c71458a8b59a920ef/pocs_yml/nucleiFiles/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-18505.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0078.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0076","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0076.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-18502","title":"WordPress subscriber 插件跨站脚本漏洞","description":"WordPress 的 Subscriber 插件（由 BestWebSoft 开发）1.3.5 之前版本存在多个存储型跨站脚本漏洞。已登录认证的攻击者可在 `bws_panel` 管理页面的 `category` 参数中注入恶意 JavaScript 代码，当管理员或其他用户访问受影响页面时脚本自动执行，可能导致会话 Cookie 窃取、管理员权限劫持或恶意操作。该漏洞影响所有使用 Subscriber 插件的 WordPress 站点，CVSS 评分 6.1，危害等级中危。用户需升级至 1.3.5 或更高版本修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2017-18502"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-08-12T16:15:13Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:12:59Z","remediation":"立即将 WordPress \"Subscriber by BestWebSoft\" 插件升级至 1.3.5 或更高版本。登录 WordPress 后台，进入「插件」→「已安装插件」，找到 \"Subscriber\" 插件点击「更新」；若无法自动更新，可从 WordPress 官方插件仓库（https://wordpress.org/plugins/subscriber/#developers）手动下载最新版本覆盖安装。升级前建议备份数据库和插件文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["https://wordpress.org/plugins/subscriber/#developers","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-18502.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-18502.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4924c84cac6ce9772babf48587bed8df9d0040d0/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-18502.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2017-18502.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0118bdf83d51e7ec6262ccd7acc694cb751b5bf8/cves/2017/18xxx/CVE-2017-18502.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6550296d9cb5b12971003dddc7912cdc0707af50/CVE/data/2017/CVE-2017-18502.json","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder3/CVE-2017-18502.yaml","https://github.com/topscoder/nuclei-wordfence-cve/blob/bdcc854494aa2f43778044680cffe9dd4de3de0e/nuclei-templates/2017/CVE-2017-18502-subscriber-77440d6e-b660-433b-9953-c1f92644302e.yaml","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2017/CVE-2017-18502.rules","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2017-18502.yaml","https://github.com/youki992/VscanPlus/blob/714a0e276a538a22c1a6215c71458a8b59a920ef/pocs_yml/nucleiFiles/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-18502.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0076.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0075","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0075.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-18501","title":"WordPress Social Login by BestWebSoft插件跨站脚本漏洞","description":"WordPress 的 social-login-bws 插件 0.2 版本之前存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞。该漏洞由于插件未对用户输入进行充分的过滤与转义处理，导致攻击者可通过向登录页面注入恶意脚本代码，当管理员或其他用户访问受影响页面时脚本自动执行，从而窃取会话 Cookie、劫持用户会话或重定向至恶意站点。攻击者需诱使用户点击特制链接，无需身份认证即可触发，CVSS 评分 6.1，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2017-18501"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-08-12T16:15:13Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:12:59Z","remediation":"升级 social-login-bws 插件至 0.2 或更高版本。在 WordPress 后台插件管理页面搜索 social-login-bws 并点击「更新」即可。如无法升级，可暂时禁用该插件并启用 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）规则过滤 XSS 攻击载荷作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["https://wordpress.org/plugins/social-login-bws/#developers","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-18501.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-18501.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4924c84cac6ce9772babf48587bed8df9d0040d0/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-18501.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2017-18501.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0118bdf83d51e7ec6262ccd7acc694cb751b5bf8/cves/2017/18xxx/CVE-2017-18501.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d2f32d8750bd50219425137a8fc56ab841cc707b/CVE/data/2017/CVE-2017-18501.json","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder3/CVE-2017-18501.yaml","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2017/CVE-2017-18501.rules","https://github.com/topscoder/nuclei-wordfence-cve/blob/bdcc854494aa2f43778044680cffe9dd4de3de0e/nuclei-templates/20