listV5/blob/0118bdf83d51e7ec6262ccd7acc694cb751b5bf8/cves/2017/18xxx/CVE-2017-18500.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d2f32d8750bd50219425137a8fc56ab841cc707b/CVE/data/2017/CVE-2017-18500.json","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder3/CVE-2017-18500.yaml","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2017/CVE-2017-18500.rules","https://github.com/topscoder/nuclei-wordfence-cve/blob/bdcc854494aa2f43778044680cffe9dd4de3de0e/nuclei-templates/2017/CVE-2017-18500-social_buttons_pack-085b39e4-2e38-4e9d-af1a-f8981d5c6ed5.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2017-18500.yaml","https://github.com/youki992/VscanPlus/blob/714a0e276a538a22c1a6215c71458a8b59a920ef/pocs_yml/nucleiFiles/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-18500.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0074.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0128","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0128.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-8229","title":"Amcrest IPM-721S 未授权信息泄露漏洞","description":"Amcrest IPM-721S 摄像头固件 V2.420.AC00.16.R.20160909 版本存在未授权信息泄漏漏洞，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向设备发送特制 HTTP 请求，直接读取并下载存储于设备内的管理员账户配置信息，进而获取明文或哈希密码。该固件中的 sonia 进程在处理文件路径别名时，将 Web 路径 /current_config 映射至设备内部存储目录 /mnt/mtd/Config，该目录下包含 Account1、Account2、Sha1Account1 等敏感配置文件。攻击者无需任何凭据，仅需构造访问路径 http://目标IP/current_config/Sha1Account1 即可直接下载包含管理员哈希密码在内的账户配置数据，进而实现账户接管或进一步渗透内网。该漏洞影响 Amcrest IPM-721S 网络摄像头产品，由于攻击不需要身份认证且可直接远程触发，CVSS 评分为 9.8，危害等级为严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2017-8229"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-07-03T20:15:10Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:26:00Z","remediation":"立即将Amcrest IPM-721S摄像头固件升级至V2.420.AC00.16.R.20160909之后的最新版本，以修复未授权访问/current_config/Sha1Account1路径导致的管理员凭据泄露漏洞。如无法立即升级，可在网络边界防火墙中禁止外部IP访问摄像头的HTTP/HTTPS管理端口（80/443），并启用网络访问控制列表（ACL）限制仅授权网段可访问设备，同时修改设备默认管理员密码。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/153224/Amcrest-IPM-721S-Credential-Disclosure-Privilege-Escalation.html","https://github.com/ethanhunnt/IoT_vulnerabilities/blob/master/Amcrest_sec_issues.pdf","https://seclists.org/bugtraq/2019/Jun/8","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-8229.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b3a270a001a31742516eaea5c494f365de9d3c80/2017/CVE-2017-8229.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/467e8414b7cae9064886839b1c4a1f4c155804ed/2017/CVE-2017-8229.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/3887f9deba3194900fbfb1022d8155887325c384/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-8229.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/CVE-2017-8229.yaml","https://github.com/Threekiii/Awesome-POC/blob/0f9e22b660cb1ea12c1c3668f9128d93e08da412/网络设备漏洞/Amcrest IP Camera Web Sha1Account1 账号密码泄漏漏洞 CVE-2017-8229.md","https://github.com/PeiQi0/PeiQi-WIKI-Book/blob/f4596359a8b7b31ae4d231eeaec711706b892ed2/docs/wiki/iot/Amcrest/Amcrest IP Camera Web Sha1Account1 账号密码泄漏漏洞 CVE-2017-8229.md","https://github.com/zan8in/afrog/blob/9c47a2b9b7e12375757acdfbc179354920c87bd8/pocs/afrog-pocs/CVE/2017/CVE-2017-8229.yaml","https://github.com/Threekiii/Vulnerability-Wiki/blob/b32b83c01eabac4d6b4b334852be9cff76ba67ee/docs-base/docs/iot/Amcrest-IP-Camera-Web-Sha1Account1-账号密码泄漏漏洞-CVE-2017-8229.md","https://github.com/SleepingBag945/dddd/blob/4c428a7c171275bfbb5fa72c2fb4bd7b48f4ff4a/common/config/pocs/CVE-2017-8229.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d856f6c74dc5fe460aff45fba36c20f9dfe1a1dc/cves/2017/8xxx/CVE-2017-8229.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2017/POC-AVE-2017-0128.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2017/EXP-AVE-2017-0128.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0128.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0118","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0118.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-5871","title":"Odoo 开放重定向漏洞","description":"Odoo 8.0 版本（20160726 及之前）及 9.0 版本存在 CWE-601 开放重定向漏洞，由于对用户输入的重定向 URL 缺乏充分验证，远程攻击者可构造恶意链接诱导用户点击，将受害者重定向至恶意站点以窃取敏感信息（如会话凭证、个人信息）。该漏洞 CVSS 3.0 评分 5.4（中危），攻击向量为网络（AV:N），攻击复杂度低（AC:L），无需权限（PR:N）但需用户交互（UI:R），影响机密性与完整性（C:L/I:L），不影响可用性。攻击者可通过钓鱼邮件、恶意链接等方式诱导用户点击，利用开放重定向跳转至钓鱼页面窃取敏感数据。受影响版本为 Odoo 8.0 ≤ 20160726 及 9.0 版本，官方已发布修复版本修复该输入验证缺陷。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.4,"aliases":["CVE-2017-5871"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-05-22T20:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:21:21Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Odoo 至 8.0-20160726 之后的版本或 9.0 后续修复版本（如 9.0-20170726 及以上），通过官方渠道下载最新安全补丁包并应用。若暂时无法升级，可在 Nginx/Apache 反向代理层配置重定向白名单，限制仅允许跳转至可信域名，或在 odoo.conf 中设置 list_db = False 限制数据库列表泄露，同时在防火墙层面限制管理后台访问源 IP。定期检查 Odoo 官方安全公告（https://www.odoo.com/page/security）获取最新补丁信息。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["https://sysdream.com/news/lab/2017-11-20-cve-2017-5871-odoo-url-redirection-to-distrusted-site-open-redirect/","https://www.odoo.com","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-5871.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-5871.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/c9097bc88f77c877a08830c8bb997e760d5172eb/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-5871.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/fc5c3e6f60accc24b7eac4fd31472f0e5fd97f24/cves/2017/5xxx/CVE-2017-5871.json","https://github.com/0x727/FingerprintHub/blob/881db81e73cc7e2f9f510b557401bea4324e5731/plugins/odoo/odoo/CVE-2017-5871.yaml","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/6a32bab1b63e302ab8a4aae06190853195172067/2017/CVE-2017-5871.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2017/CVE-2017-5871.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2017/CVE-2017-5871.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/0c8771e89b9e76278d77bdb22e6a7f5061b52570/CVE/data/2017/CVE-2017-5871.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2017/CVE-2017-5871.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2017/CVE-2017-5871","https://github.com/1337rokudenashi/Odoo-leq-8.0-20160726-and-9.0-Open-Redirect"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0118.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0608","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0608.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-18368","title":"ZyXEL P660HN-T1A 路由器远程系统日志转发功能命令注入漏洞","description":"ZyXEL P660HN-T1A 路由器（TrueOnline 分发版本 v1 TCLinux Fw $7.3.15.0 v001 / 3.40(ULM.0)b31）的 ViewLog.asp 页面存在命令注入漏洞，位于远程系统日志转发功能的 remote_host 参数中。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过构造恶意参数注入任意系统命令，在路由器上以最高权限执行代码，完全控制设备。该漏洞无需用户交互、无需认证即可远程利用，CVSS 评分 9.8（严重），影响设备的完整性、机密性与可用性。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2017-18368"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2019-05-02T17:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:12:42Z","remediation":"立即禁用路由器的远程系统日志转发功能（Remote System Log），在 Web 管理界面中取消勾选 System Log → Remote Log 中的启用选项。在防火墙层面限制对路由器 Web 管理端口（默认 80/443）的访问，仅允许受信任的内部 IP 连接。如无法禁用该功能，建议将设备替换为仍在厂商支持周期内的型号（如 ZyXEL USG 系列），或刷写第三方固件（如 OpenWrt）以彻底消除该命令注入风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.zyxel.com/support/announcement_unauthenticated.shtml","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/pedrib/PoC/master/advisories/zyxel_trueonline.txt","https://seclists.org/fulldisclosure/2017/Jan/40","https://ssd-disclosure.com/index.php/archives/2910","https://unit42.paloaltonetworks.com/new-mirai-variant-targets-enterprise-wireless-presentation-display-systems/","http