身份认证即可通过 Kaseya VSA Web 接口访问 ManagedIT.asmx 页面，执行任意 SQL 读写操作，直接获取 VSA 数据库完全控制权。2019 年 2 月该漏洞已被在野利用，攻击者通过注入恶意 SQL 下载并执行勒索软件，加密所有由 VSA 服务器管理的终端设备数据。该漏洞影响所有使用 ConnectWise ManagedITSync 集成的 Kaseya VSA 版本，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2017-18362"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-02-05T06:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:12:41Z","remediation":"该产品（ConnectWise ManagedITSync for Kaseya VSA）已停止维护（End-of-Life），无安全补丁可用。建议立即从 Kaseya VSA 服务器上禁用或卸载 ManagedITSync 集成组件，并在防火墙层面限制对 ManagedIT.asmx 页面的外部访问。如业务依赖该功能，应迁移至受支持的替代方案。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archive.today/rdkeQ","https://github.com/kbni/owlky","https://webcache.googleusercontent.com/search?q=cache:ZEo8ZRF_iEIJ:https://helpdesk.kaseya.com/hc/en-gb/articles/360022495572-Connectwise-API-Vulnerability+","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2017-18362","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-18362.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-18362.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4924c84cac6ce9772babf48587bed8df9d0040d0/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-18362.yaml","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/cceeecf6089ddc2f031595910377878b5b1f87cd/data/by-cve/CVE-2017-18362.md","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/4284f6963ad44b6747121c735d36bdcd1745ea43/2017/CVE-2017-18362.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2017/CVE-2017-18362.md","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/cceeecf6089ddc2f031595910377878b5b1f87cd/data/2017/CVE-2017-18362-yawningmoney_CVE-2017-18362-LAB.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d2f32d8750bd50219425137a8fc56ab841cc707b/CVE/data/2017/CVE-2017-18362.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d2f32d8750bd50219425137a8fc56ab841cc707b/SSVC/data/2017/CVE-2017-18362.json","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2017/CVE-2017-18362.rules","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2017-18362.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2017/POC-AVE-2017-0606.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2017/EXP-AVE-2017-0606.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0606.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0065","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0065.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-18349","title":"阿里巴巴 Fastjson 反序列化远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Fastjson 1.2.24及之前版本中的 parseObject 方法存在反序列化安全漏洞。攻击者可通过向目标服务器发送特制的 JSON 请求，在 dataSourceName 字段中构造恶意的 rmi:// URI，触发 autoType 机制加载恶意类，从而在未经身份认证的情况下实现远程代码执行。该漏洞影响所有使用 Fastjson 1.2.24 及更早版本的产品（包括 Pippo 1.11.0 等），CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2017-18349"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-10-23T20:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:12:39Z","remediation":"立即升级 Fastjson 至 1.2.25 或更高版本，该版本引入了 autoType 白名单安全机制，可有效防御反序列化攻击。如无法升级，可启用 safeMode（ParserConfig.getGlobalInstance().setSafeMode(true)）或通过 JVM 参数 -Dfastjson.parser.autoTypeSupport=false 禁用 autoType 功能，并在代码中调用 ParserConfig.getGlobalInstance().setAutoTypeSupport(false) 关闭自动类型解析。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["https://fortiguard.com/encyclopedia/ips/44059","https://github.com/alibaba/fastjson/wiki/security_update_20170315","https://github.com/pippo-java/pippo/issues/466","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-18349.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-18349.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/7fe82fb470b3291b506f74c6717a29e3837f8a29/2017/CVE-2017-18349.json","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4924c84cac6ce9772babf48587bed8df9d0040d0/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-18349.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/93bf7691fc17bf58197ad166ee362b4808566d7c/cves/2017/18xxx/CVE-2017-18349.json","https://github.com/vulhub/vulhub/blob/aeaf65793f147f29bd50841ef77f4e9cad07ecc7/fastjson/1.2.24-rce/README.md","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/4284f6963ad44b6747121c735d36bdcd1745ea43/2017/CVE-2017-18349.json","https://github.com/vulhub/vulhub/blob/aeaf65793f147f29bd50841ef77f4e9cad07ecc7/fastjson/1.2.24-rce/README.zh-cn.md","https://github.com/ReAbout/audit-java/blob/de0f19b0204e9853fb1a84b249d6d045e327b254/poc/CVE-2017-18349.md","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2017/CVE-2017-18349.md","https://github.com/gelusus/wxvl/blob/94576818ed78a5f4279cd7c5dd905d16cb5cdd4d/doc/2024-06/FastJson-RCE (CVE-2017-18349) 漏洞复现.md","https://github.com/h0cksr/Fastjson--CVE-2017-18349-","https://github.com/Dungsocool/CVE-2017-18349"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2017/POC-AVE-2017-0065.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2017/EXP-AVE-2017-0065.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0065.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0063","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0063.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-17762","title":"Episerver XML外部实体注入漏洞","description":"Episerver 7 patch 4及更早版本中存在XML外部实体（XXE）漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证，可通过向util/xmlrpc/Handler.ashx接口发送包含恶意DTD的XML请求，利用该漏洞读取服务器上的任意文件。该漏洞源于应用程序在处理XML请求时未正确禁用外部实体的解析，导致攻击者可以引用外部DTD文件读取系统敏感文件（如配置文件、密码文件等）。CVSS评分7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2017-17762"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-08-29T19:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:11:36Z","remediation":"立即升级到 Episerver 7 Patch 5 或更高版本。如无法立即升级，可在 Web 服务器防火墙或反向代理层面拦截所有路径以 /util/xmlrpc 开头的 HTTP 请求，并限制 Web 服务器出站 TCP 连接和 DNS 查询，以阻断 XXE 带外数据外传通道。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://gist.github.com/jonaslejon/5f92779848360a1a1e676af0795bd9aa","https://kryptera.se/sarbarhet-i-episerver/","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-17762.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-17762.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4924c84cac6ce9772babf48587bed8df9d0040d0/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-17762.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/487ea3f21ed49470634e758e1f8f2ac74b64d6b0/cves/2017/17xxx/CVE-2017-17762.json","https://github.com/0x727/FingerprintHub/blob/881db81e73cc7e2f9f510b557401bea4324e5731/plugins/episerver/episerver/CVE-2017-17762.yaml","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2017/CVE-2017-17762.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2017/CVE-2017-17762.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2017/CVE-2017-17762","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2017/CVE-2017-17762.rules","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2017-17762.yaml","https://github.com/youki992/VscanPlus/blob/714a0e276a538a22c1a6215c71458a8b59a920ef/pocs_yml/nucleiFiles/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-17762.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0063.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0013","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0013.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-0929","title":"DNN (DotNetNuke) DnnImageHandler 服务端请求伪造漏洞","description":"DotNetNuke（DNN）9.2.0之前版本中的DnnImageHandler类存在服务端请求伪造（SSRF）漏洞。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制的HTTP请求，利用ImageHandler组件发起内部网络资源探测，从而获取内网敏感信息。该漏洞影响所有DNN 9.2.0之前版本，CVSS评分7.5，危害等级高。官方已在9.2.0版本中修复此漏洞，建议用户及时升级。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2017-0929"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-07-03T21:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:58:32Z","remediation":"建议立即将 DotNetNuke (DNN) 升级至 9.2.0 或更高版本，该版本已修复 DnnImageHandler 类中的 SSRF 漏洞。如无法立即升级，可在 Web 应用防火墙 (WAF) 层面添加规则，阻止向内部网络地址（如 127.0.0.1、10.x.x.x、172.16-31.x.x、192.168.x.x）发起的出站请求，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/dnnsoftware/Dnn.Platform/commit/d3953db85fee77bb5e6383747692c507ef8b94c3","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-0929.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-0929.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4924c84cac6ce9772babf48587bed8df9d0040d0/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-0929.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/cve-2017-0929.yaml","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2017/CVE-2017-0929.rules","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/6442cc5e7200c513b7657ab6312f5f41cffcced0/2017/CVE-2017-0929.json","https://github.com/0xKayala/Custom-Nuclei-Templates/blob/1940dfd29577590f076c89dec5c30d809d68f210/8001-to-9000-templates/CVE-2017-0929%20(copy%201).yaml","https://github.com/GGStudy-DDUp/NucleiTP/blob/ba6a067118144778bfd31a15d84a55c743c416cc/TPALL/cve-2017-0929.yaml","https://github.com/bugbountydude/Nuclei-TamplatesBackup/blob/5b11129134e315fec1d8e8e09b8f468254fa654c/CVE-2017-0929.yaml","https://github.com/zcyberseclab/zscan/blob/8c5a8daeed6afdf16f6945c24a51469d37a023b9/poc_stats.md","https://github.com/elijah-bennett0/IntentLimit/blob/bcfe225cf61ee454aa53896f7f3120246f52119f/tools/exploitation/GoldenBullet/exploits/cve_2017_0929/cve_2017_0929.py"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0013.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0500","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0500.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-12319","title":"Cisco IOS XE BGP EVPN 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Cisco IOS XE 软件中 BGP over EVPN 功能存在输入验证不当漏洞。由于在处理 BGP Inclusive Multicast Ethernet Tag Route 或 BGP EVPN MAC/IP Advertisement Route 更新报文时，IP 地址长度字段计算错误，导致未认证的远程攻击者可在已建立的 BGP 会话中向目标设备发送特制的 BGP 报文，触发设备重载或破坏 BGP 路由表，造成拒绝服务（DoS）和网络不稳定。该漏洞影响所有支持 BGP EVPN 配置的 Cisco IOS XE 16.3 之前版本，若设备未配置 EVPN 则不受影响。CVSS 评分 5.9，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.9,"aliases":["CVE-2017-12319"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2018-03-27T09:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:03:06Z","remediation":"建议立即将 Cisco IOS XE 软件升级至 16.3 或更高版本，该版本已修复 BGP EVPN 报文处理中的输入验证缺陷。如无法立即升级，可在未使用 EVPN 功能的设备上移除 EVPN 配置以消除攻击面，同时通过访问控制列表（ACL）限制 BGP 对等体的连接来源，仅允许可信 IP 建立 BGP 会话。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/101676","https://tools.cisco.com/security/center/content/CiscoSecurityAdvisory/cisco-sa-20171103-bgp","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2017-12319","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-12319.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/49bdd0da7f9ed7eb2c6a7d376de641a46364c00a/cves/2017/12xxx/CVE-2017-12319.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2017/CVE-2017-12319","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/e1dac7e3201a376abf5c74e8edebb6384afa032f/2017/12xxx/CVE-2017-12319.json","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2017-12319.txt","https://github.com/Ostorlab/KEV/blob/8feadeb8b7ff54359eab87941769781629146b23/README.md","https://github.com/eyalmazuz/ThreatIntelligenceCorpus/blob/c47f9d2b7ba92e0cbba71c67b938a49e055c5cdc/Corpus/128780.txt","https://github.com/lucacapacci/cisa_kev/blob/63008d9134e74f63e93e48616bac78e5f7abdf5b/data_single/2017/CVE-2017-12319.csv","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d91e95989ea5d3a9186ceb621d53a71dff03cab4/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-f2xf-pppv-v6j6/GHSA-f2xf-pppv-v6j6.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2017/CVE-2017-12319.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0500.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0052","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0052.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-15715","title":"Apache HTTPD 换行解析漏洞","description":"Apache HTTPD 2.4.0 至 2.4.29 版本中的 `<FilesMatch>` 指令存在正则表达式解析绕过漏洞。由于正则表达式中 `$` 锚点不仅匹配字符串结尾，还可匹配换行符 `\\n`，攻击者可通过在恶意文件名末尾附加换行符（如 `\\x0A`，对应 URL 编码 `%0a`）构造特制文件名（例如 `shell.php%0a`），使 `<FilesMatch \\.php$>` 规则将文件名判定为以 `.php` 结尾，从而绕过服务器对上传文件类型的拦截策略，将 PHP 文件上传至服务器并执行，最终导致远程代码执行或未授权访问。该漏洞影响 Apache HTTP Server 2.4.0 至 2.4.29 版本，攻击者可于远程发起攻击，无需身份认证，但需攻击者能上传文件且服务器启用了基于 `<FilesMatch>` 的文件类型过滤，攻击复杂度较高。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.1,"aliases":["CVE-2017-15715"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-03-26T15:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:08:09Z","remediation":"升级 Apache httpd 至 2.4.30 及以上版本，该版本修复了 <FilesMatch> 中 $ 锚点匹配换行符的问题。如无法立即升级，可将文件上传目录的 <FilesMatch> 规则改为使用 \\z 替代 $ 作为结尾锚点，或在应用层对上传文件名做换行符（%0a、%0d）过滤与校验。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2018/03/24/6","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/103525","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1040570","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2018:3558","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2019:0366","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2019:0367","https://httpd.apache.org/security/vulnerabilities_24.html","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/56c2e7cc9deb1c12a843d0dc251ea7fd3e7e80293cde02fcd65286ba%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https